Bundle id: com.corral.fleetnotifier (lowercase). Each launch starts from a
WIPED install (uninstall + install + launch) so stale multi-host profiles
from earlier evidence never gate the recents presentation (observed:
profiles persisted by the #401 add-host evidence runs make
requestRecents return early — the single-host demo state must be clean).

Capture driver: /tmp/fn428-capture.sh (marker poll under
<data>/Documents/ux-evidence, `simctl io screenshot` per new marker,
`sips -z 844 390` downscale; the DEBUG driver holds >= 4 s after each
marker and the host shoots ~1.5-2.5 s into the hold).

Native-glass branch (medium detent, Mocha+Latte + Frappé/Macchiato spot):

$ xcrun simctl launch <udid> com.corral.fleetnotifier \
    -corral416TranslucencyEvidence -corral416MediumDetents
  -> the committed phase-416-{1..7} frames (medium glass)
$ ... -corral416TranslucencyEvidence -corral416MediumDetents \
    -corral428SpotFlavors
  -> renamed to the committed phase-416-5-settings-frappe /
     phase-416-6-settings-macchiato / phase-416-2-recents-frappe /
     phase-416-3-recents-macchiato frames

Release presentation path (system LARGE detent):

$ xcrun simctl launch <udid> com.corral.fleetnotifier \
    -corral416TranslucencyEvidence
  -> renamed to the committed phase-416-5-settings-mocha-large /
     phase-416-6-settings-latte-large frames

Forced material fallback (iOS 17-25 recipe on the 26.5 runtime — see the
README): every run above repeated with `-corral416ForceFallbackBackdrop`;
frames renamed to the `-fallback` suffixed files in this directory.

Add Host (multi-host seed, medium detent):

$ xcrun simctl launch <udid> com.corral.fleetnotifier \
    -corralDemoMultiHostAddEvidence -corral416MediumDetents
  -> phase-7-addhost-entry-mocha / phase-8-addhost-confirm-latte
  (+ `-corral416ForceFallbackBackdrop` -> the -fallback files)

